rewardbench_sample.jsonl contains information from the RewardBench evaluation
dataset by Allen Institute for AI and its contributors:
https://huggingface.co/datasets/allenai/reward-bench
which is made available under the Open Data Commons Attribution License
(ODC-By) v1.0:
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/by/1-0/

The sample is a stratified, rearranged and potentially truncated derivative.
It is not relicensed under MIT. Individual contents can have additional
rights/conditions not covered by the database license. See ../THIRD-PARTY.md
for sources, transformations and scope.
